;; Every variable here is pushed by `eww-state`, the only thing allowed to write
;; them or to open and close these windows. No defpolls: what to sample and how
;; often lives in the daemon's state machine (`eww-state polls` prints the plan),
;; and the literals below are only what shows before the first push lands.
;;
;; Table of contents only. modules-bar/ is the menu bar and its dropdowns,
;; modules-shell/ the standalone surfaces.

